// Rundll32 Execution Without Parameters | T1021.002, T1569.002, T1570 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_rundll32_without_parameters.yml
CommandLine:(rundll32.exe OR rundll32)

